# r-pathway deliberately builds from the repository root so it can install the
# shared OmixPathwayPlots source package. Limit that context to its own inputs.
*
!starter-environments/
!starter-environments/r-pathway/
!starter-environments/r-pathway/Dockerfile
!starter-environments/r-pathway/renv.lock
!packages/
!packages/OmixPathwayPlots/
!packages/OmixPathwayPlots/**
